(text "REFERENCE LIMIT SWITCHES - NORMALLY CLOSED" (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "247f5c45-f36c-4cc9-a30d-265e58a271ad"))
(text "J108-J111 mount on the perfboard. SW1-SW3 mount on the robot. Global labels connect the cable endpoints." (at 15.24 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b5c1a5a0-4aa2-478d-9913-07800c382d63"))
(text "J108 -> Nucleo A1\n1 = PE7 / CN10.20 (M1)\n3 = PE8 / CN10.18 (M2)\n5 = PE10 / CN10.24 (M3)\n2, 4, 6 = GND / CN10.22" (at 20.32 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5800a680-b95f-4a04-93dd-46ae1fc37132"))
(text "INPUT BEHAVIOR\nNucleo internal pull-ups to 3.3 V.\nReleased: COM-NC closed -> LOW.\nPressed / unplugged: open -> HIGH.\nBoth-edge EXTI; raw, un-debounced inputs.\nHoming and motor-stop logic not yet implemented." (at 20.32 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60cc46d9-ccd2-4875-a33b-d6af38067e4b"))
(text "BEFORE WIRING: With the switch disconnected, verify continuity: closed when released, open when pressed.\nCOM / NC / NO identify contact functions, NOT the module connector pin order. Do not infer power wiring from V/G/S printing.\nUse the unpopulated mechanical version as a dry contact; no supply connection. Route each REF with its GND return, away from motor wiring." (at 20.32 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b214be4-8d6a-4aaf-82c1-197e8ee9473c"))
(text "Switches shown released (COM-NC closed)." (at 281.94 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0f6be050-ab96-4740-8e74-37b01e42ea32"))
)
